#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-spiffe-client.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"https://spiffe.io/[SPIFFE] (Secure Production Identity Framework for Everyone) provides cryptographic workload identities in zero-trust environments.\n"
"The SPIFFE client extension uses the https://github.com/spiffe/spiffe/blob/main/standards/SPIFFE_Workload_API.md[Workload API] to retrieve https://github.com/spiffe/spiffe/blob/main/standards/JWT-SVID.md[JWT Verifiable Identity Documents (JWT-SVIDs)] for Quarkus workloads directly from the local https://spiffe.io/docs/latest/spire-about/spire-concepts/[SPIRE Agent].\n"
"It simplifies deployment by eliminating the need for a SPIFFE client sidecar that stores JWT-SVIDs on a mounted file path for Quarkus to read."
msgstr "link:https://spiffe.io/[SPIFFE] (Secure Production Identity Framework for Everyone) proporciona identidades criptográficas para cargas de trabajo en entornos de confianza cero. La extensión de cliente de SPIFFE utiliza la link:https://github.com/spiffe/spiffe/blob/main/standards/SPIFFE_Workload_API.md[API de cargas de trabajo] para recuperar link:https://github.com/spiffe/spiffe/blob/main/standards/JWT-SVID.md[documentos de identidad verificables JWT (JWT-SVID)] para las cargas de trabajo de Quarkus directamente desde el link:https://spiffe.io/docs/latest/spire-about/spire-concepts/[agente SPIRE] local. Esto simplifica la implementación, ya que elimina la necesidad de un sidecar de cliente SPIFFE que almacene los JWT-SVID en una ruta de archivo montada para que Quarkus pueda leerlos."

