#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-spiffe-client.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid "The extension requires the URI of the SPIRE Agent's Workload Endpoint socket:"
msgstr "La extensión requiere el URI del socket del punto final de carga de trabajo del agente SPIRE:"

#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-spiffe-client.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If `quarkus.spiffe-client.endpoint-socket` is not set, the extension falls back to the standard `SPIFFE_ENDPOINT_SOCKET` environment variable as defined by the https://spiffe.io/docs/latest/spiffe-specs/spiffe_workload_endpoint/#4-locating-the-endpoint[SPIFFE Workload Endpoint specification].\n"
"This environment variable is typically set by the SPIRE Agent for workloads it manages."
msgstr "Si no se ha configurado « `quarkus.spiffe-client.endpoint-socket` », la extensión recurre a la variable de entorno estándar « `SPIFFE_ENDPOINT_SOCKET` », tal y como se define en la link:https://spiffe.io/docs/latest/spiffe-specs/spiffe_workload_endpoint/#4-locating-the-endpoint[especificación SPIFFE Workload Endpoint] . Normalmente, el agente SPIRE configura esta variable de entorno para las cargas de trabajo que gestiona."

#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-spiffe-client.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid "The URI must use one of the following schemes, as defined by the https://github.com/spiffe/spiffe/blob/main/standards/SPIFFE_Workload_Endpoint.md[SPIFFE Workload Endpoint] specification:"
msgstr "El URI debe utilizar uno de los siguientes esquemas, tal y como se definen en la especificación link:https://github.com/spiffe/spiffe/blob/main/standards/SPIFFE_Workload_Endpoint.md[«SPIFFE Workload Endpoint] »:"

#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-spiffe-client.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid "`unix://` for Unix Domain Sockets (production default), for example `unix:///run/spire/sockets/agent.sock`"
msgstr "`unix://` para los sockets de dominio Unix (valor predeterminado en producción), por ejemplo `unix:///run/spire/sockets/agent.sock`"

#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-spiffe-client.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid "`tcp://` for TCP connections (development and testing), for example `tcp://127.0.0.1:8080`"
msgstr "`tcp://` para conexiones TCP (desarrollo y pruebas), por ejemplo `tcp://127.0.0.1:8080`"

#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-spiffe-client.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For the `tcp` scheme, the host must be an IP address and a port is required.\n"
"Hostnames are not accepted."
msgstr "En el caso del esquema « `tcp` », el host debe ser una dirección IP y es necesario indicar un puerto. No se aceptan nombres de host."

#. type: Plain text
#: _versions/main/guides/security-spiffe-client.adoc
#, fuzzy
msgid "On Windows, only the `tcp://` scheme is currently supported."
msgstr "En Windows, actualmente solo se admite el esquema « `tcp://` »."

